title square screen, the record countdown over the cassette window
sizes 720x720
ppmm 800
env CASSETTE_DEMO countdown
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 600
shot countdown
expect text "RECORDING IN"
expect text "3"
expect text "tap here, STOP or Esc cancels"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
tap "RECORDING IN"
wait 300
expect notext "RECORDING IN"
shot countdown-cancelled
expect noquit
